  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You drive a splinter of psychic force into the mind of a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on an Intelligence saving throw or take 1d6 Psychic damage; it then subtracts 1d4 from the next saving throw it makes before the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-gagFL8qeQEiLhyf8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect lasts until the end of your next turn: delete it once the target has made its next saving throw.</p></section>",
